 ~~~~~~~~~~~~
 
 * Change project license metadata to use an SPDX license expression.
+* Do not canonicalize the version of arbitrary equality (``===``) specifiers when
+  comparing them, so that a ``SpecifierSet`` such as ``===1.0,===1.0.0`` keeps
+  both specifiers and matches their intersection. (:issue:`943`)
 
 
